{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "91f2a7c83d4e5b60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# MANOVA\n\nCompare response means jointly. Build hypothesis and error SSCP matrices, choose a criterion, then check its reference distribution and the scope of the conclusion.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n多元方差分析：联合比较响应均值，构造假设与误差 SSCP，选择统计量，核对参考分布与结论范围。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a1b2c3d4e5f6071",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1530,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[MANOVA经典假设|Classical assumptions]]\n\nIndependent Gaussian errors, common positive-definite covariance, estimable effects and sufficient residual rank support the classical reference law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n独立 Gaussian 误差、共同正定协方差、可估效应与足够残差秩支持经典参考分布；它们不构成 MANOVA 概念本身。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b2c3d4e5f607182",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[MANOVA|MANOVA]]\n\nA joint test of a prespecified effect on several responses. In one-way groups, $H_0:\\mu_1=\\cdots=\\mu_g$ compares population mean vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对多个响应的预设效应作联合检验；单因素特例比较各组总体均值向量。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c3d4e5f60718293",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[多响应一般线性假设]]\n*复用：一般形式*\n\n$H_0:CBA=D$ 同时选择系数方向与响应方向；MANOVA 是多响应线性模型的联合检验用法。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4e5f60718293a4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[多响应残差与误差SSP|多响应残差与误差 SSCP]]\n*复用：对象边界*\n\n逐观测残差矩阵与 $p\\times p$ 误差 SSCP 不同；MANOVA 中的 $E$ 指后者。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e5f60718293a4b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[MANOVA SSCP分解|One-way SSCP decomposition]]\n\n$T=H+E$: between-group plus within-group variation. Degrees of freedom for $H,E,T$ are $g-1,N-g,N-1$; these are not matrix ranks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n总变动拆成组间与组内变动，保留交叉乘积；恒等式不依赖正态抽样，统计推断另需模型。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[误差SSP秩边界|误差 SSCP 秩边界]]\n*复用：可逆边界*\n\n$\\operatorname{rank}(E)\\le\\min(p,N-g)$；求 $E^{-1}$ 前先查残差自由度与实际响应共线。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "60718293a4b5c6d7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[MANOVA四种统计量|Four MANOVA criteria]]\n\nFor $E$ positive definite, compare the nonnegative roots of $E^{-1}H$. Wilks uses a product; Pillai a bounded sum; Hotelling–Lawley a sum; Roy the largest root.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在 $E$ 正定时汇总同一组非负根。Wilks 越小、其余三者越大，越反对零假设；原始统计量不是 p 值。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4c5e6f708192b3c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Pillai稳健性边界|Pillai robustness]]\n\nComparative evidence is conditional on the studied designs and violations. A lower false-rejection rate than rivals can still exceed the nominal level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n比较稳健性有研究范围；比对手的错误率低，仍可能高于名义水平。更换统计量不能修复依赖、不可估或错误校准。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "718293a4b5c6d8e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1530,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[MANOVA检验校准|From criterion to p-value]]\n\nUse the sampling model, response dimension $p$, hypothesis dimension $q$ and residual degrees $\\nu$. Software often uses approximate F calibration.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n维度与误差模型共同决定参考尾概率；软件的 F 列或“exact”选项都不能代替抽样条件。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "8293a4b5c6d7e9f0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应联合显著边界|Interpreting joint rejection]]\n\nA valid rejection is evidence against the specified joint null, not proof that every response differs. A combination can be unusual even when no separate coordinate test rejects. Follow-up comparisons need their own error control.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n联合拒绝提供反对预设零假设的证据，不证明每个响应都不同。即使逐坐标都不拒绝，某个组合也可能异常；后续定位需要自身的错误率控制。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b4c5d6e7f80912",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多响应因果边界|Causal interpretation]]\n\nDefine the intervention and target population, then justify identification. A causal joint test needs both that argument and valid statistical calibration; adding responses does not supply either.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先定义干预与目标总体，再建立识别依据。因果联合检验同时需要识别论证与有效统计校准；增加响应个数不会自动提供这些条件。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "93a4b5c6d7e8f001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## 相邻入口\n\n- 两组与单均值：[[Hotelling T² 与多元均值推断.canvas|Hotelling T²]]\n- 一般共享设计：[[多元线性回归.canvas|多元线性回归]]\n- 协方差抽样律：[[Wishart 分布与样本协方差推断.canvas|Wishart]]"
    }
  ],
